  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Heavenly Court, after endless punches already leave Calamity Luck Altar unable to endure, Duke Long activates the immortal killer move World Shaking Dragon Hammer. The blow smashes the rising rank eight Immortal Gu House back down, kills a huge number of Gu worms, and opens a hole that exposes Bing Sai Chuan.",
      "chapters": [
        1733
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "char_duke_long",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the fate war, Duke Long again uses World Shaking Dragon Hammer against Calamity Luck Altar; the surface shatters, many Gu worms die, and a finger-sized hole opens through which the inside can be seen.",
      "chapters": [
        1928
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "strikes-calamity-luck-altar-again",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He later rushes through stacked killer moves and slams Calamity Luck Altar with the same move, sending it dozens of steps back with a deep caved pit at the impact point.",
      "chapters": [
        1930
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "strikes-calamity-luck-altar-again",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Fang Yuan’s Myriad Year Flying Warship, a dragon hammer strike sends the warship flying.",
      "chapters": [
        1943
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "warship-struck",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "house_myriad_year_flying_warship"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Duke Long’s transformation path combat system, dragon claw strike, chaotic dragon fist, spiraling dragon fangs, and world shaking dragon hammer handle offense across close, mid-range, and long range; world shaking dragon hammer is even more powerful and can turn a situation around.",
      "chapters": [
        1945
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "combat-system",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long nears Myriad Year Flying Warship and uses killer moves like world shaking dragon hammer alternately, destroying daybreak swords and cracking the warship. He later appears behind Fang Yuan and uses World Shaking Dragon Hammer; Fang Yuan activates reverse flow protection seal, which finally reaches its limits and breaks, and the reflected force also heavily injures Duke Long.",
      "chapters": [
        1953
      ],
